# CREDITS — SWISS MOTION 10 s test

## 风格与工具

- **Style prompt**: `styles/swiss-motion/STYLE.md` from
  [lemo-opuscar](https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), © LemoLab, MIT.
- **Render / mux / readcheck tools**: `core/render/` from the same library, MIT
  (`video.mjs`, `mux.sh`, `readcheck.mjs`, `still.mjs`, `serve.mjs`, `page.mjs`).
- The film itself is ours; no LemoLab credit is required on it, and none is implied.

## 字体（SIL Open Font License 1.1）

- **Inter** — Rasmus Andersson, OFL 1.1. Latin subset (400/600/700) via the Google Fonts
  CSS API `text=` subset, self-hosted in `fonts/`.
- **Noto Sans SC** — Google, OFL 1.1. Chinese subset (400/700) of the characters used.

## 声音

- 全部由 `audio/make_audio.py` 用 numpy/scipy 程序化合成（正弦、噪声、biquad 滤波、包络），
  **不含任何采样、歌曲、人声或第三方素材**。
- 母带：ffmpeg `loudnorm` + `alimiter`，成片经 `mux.sh` 复测 −13.8 LUFS / −1.4 dBFS。

## 画面

- 无第三方图片、无素材库、无字体之外的外部资产。
